2026-10-23T10:11:15.9065519Z Linux USB/IP device management (experimental preview)
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9065893Z 
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9066047Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9066308Z 
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9066421Z Commands:
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9066968Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9067635Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9068389Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9069099Z   virtual-server      Serve two virtual test devices; this experimental mode provides no authentication or TLS
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9069750Z   devices             Scan local devices without changing drivers. Discovery is not compatibility validation
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9070343Z   doctor              Read installed tool, module and helper capabilities without loading modules
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9070929Z   discover            Query a server's USB/IP device list over an administrator-managed trusted network
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9071541Z   export              Export an administrator-allowlisted device fingerprint via the privileged helper
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9072336Z   unexport            Release an allowlisted export and request local driver reattachment
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9072856Z   attach              Import a remote bus ID through an allowlisted endpoint and Linux VHCI
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9073324Z   detach              Disconnect an authorized local VHCI port (0..255)
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9073786Z   sessions            Read authoritative native kernel session state through the helper
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9074227Z   status              Query helper and kernel status
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9074614Z   help                Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9075071Z 
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9075156Z Options:
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9075458Z       --json               Emit machine-readable JSON to stdout; logs remain on stderr
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9076046Z       --socket <SOCKET>    Root-owned local helper socket [default: /run/rustusb/control.sock]
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9076651Z       --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Discovery timeout covering DNS, connect and response [default: 10]
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9077121Z       --log-json           Emit JSON tracing logs on stderr
2026-10-23T10:11:15.9077434Z   -h, --help               Print help
